                                                "sense_id": "85a27fbc-587c-3789-a7f2-ea4959766a11",
                                                "text": "The Venezuelan gang, known as Tren de Aragua, or TDA, has a known presence in 15 states and a possible presence in eight others, according to the data."
                                            }
